struct FloatShift {
  doc "What a re-stack knows of the floats when it asks restack_settles: the lowest float bottom placed before the edited entry (before_reach, the same in both passes), the lowest bottom of every float placed in this pass and in the previous one (reach, old_reach), whether any float was placed again from the edited entry on, and whether every one of those moved by the same amount and kept its left edge, border-box size and margins (uniform, shift): a float that changed its box narrows or clears later content differently, so its move alone does not describe it.";
